Third-party software
--------------------
The build scripts download Debian packages, and the installed system downloads
container images (Immich, Jellyfin and the other apps) at first boot. None of
them are included in this repository; each is distributed under its own
license. Images built from this repository (ISO/IMG) contain Debian packages:
whoever redistributes such an image must comply with their licenses, including
making the corresponding source code available (https://sources.debian.org).
